Ticket #4471 merged two date problems because their symptoms looked alike. The report ID is
the deduplication key; intake tags are only guesses.

## Problems and outcomes

1. **Shared parser.** Day-first tenants entered DD/MM/YYYY, but the parser read the value
   month-first. [Issue 1](https://github.com/ivanneto02/MEGA-dev-what-it-shows/issues/1)
   closed as completed after `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`.

2. **booking-v3 hint.** The form prompted day-first tenants to enter MM/DD/YYYY, then the app
   interpreted the value as DD/MM/YYYY. [Issue 2](https://github.com/ivanneto02/MEGA-dev-what-it-shows/issues/2)
   closed without a fix because the booking-v3 form was retired.

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

## Since April

<QueueTimeline ticket={4471} />

The causes need different tickets because changing the shared parser cannot correct guidance
printed by a retired form.

